1
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,079
From now on, The Four Great Families, under my...

2
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:50,759
No,

3
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:52,679
under our leadership,

4
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:55,799
will crack the tomb and quell the evil, creating new glory.

5
00:00:55,799 --> 00:00:56,719
Great!

6
00:01:00,159 --> 00:01:01,439
Great!

7
00:01:02,880 --> 00:01:04,120
Young Master Li!

8
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:08,480
This speech is so moving it makes listeners weep...

9
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:09,400
Weep from disgust.

10
00:01:09,959 --> 00:01:12,879
The Four Great Families are still missing my Qi Family, right?

11
00:01:13,959 --> 00:01:16,480
Zhang Tianyou, you're actually not dead!

12
00:01:19,840 --> 00:01:20,719
What?

13
00:01:20,719 --> 00:01:21,719
Zhang Tianyou?

14
00:01:22,319 --> 00:01:23,280
It's absolutely true.

15
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:25,359
It's confirmed news from the Warlord's mansion.

16
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:26,680
I got it.

17
00:01:26,680 --> 00:01:27,280
Yes.

18
00:01:31,079 --> 00:01:32,719
Finally figured it out.

19
00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:34,239
How boring.

20
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:40,480
What's your business?

21
00:01:41,599 --> 00:01:42,760
Delivering wine.

22
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:44,439
Young Master Li announced today,

23
00:01:44,760 --> 00:01:47,000
out of consideration for everyone, he's gifting this fine wine.

24
00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:50,040
Anyone who refuses to drink is disrespecting him.

25
00:01:50,640 --> 00:01:51,519
Uncle Mei,

26
00:01:51,519 --> 00:01:52,840
he's the one who killed Jiushuang!

27
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:54,760
What did you say?

28
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:56,760
Men, seize him!

29
00:01:56,760 --> 00:01:57,640
Young Master!

30
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:01,400
The Dragon-Seeking descendant we're looking for...

31
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:03,319
What did you say? Speak up, I can't hear you!

32
00:02:03,319 --> 00:02:05,840
I said, the Dragon-Seeking descendant we're looking for is him,

33
00:02:05,879 --> 00:02:07,120
Zhang Tianyou!

34
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:15,159
You...

35
00:02:15,159 --> 00:02:17,719
Handsome, you're late.

36
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:19,280
Three penalty drinks for you.

37
00:02:22,439 --> 00:02:24,879
Did you really kill my daughter?

38
00:02:25,199 --> 00:02:26,240
Don't pin this on me.

39
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:26,919
As for me,

40
00:02:26,919 --> 00:02:29,599
my biggest flaw is that I hate being a scapegoat.

41
00:02:29,599 --> 00:02:31,960
So I brought a witness here just for this.

42
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:33,080
Jiushuang!

43
00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:33,919
If you don't come in,

44
00:02:33,919 --> 00:02:35,800
your dad is going to chop me into dumpling filling!

45
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:36,639
Impossible.

46
00:02:36,639 --> 00:02:37,280
Dad!

47
00:02:37,639 --> 00:02:38,439
Shuang'er!

48
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:40,039
The one who wanted to bury me alive,

49
00:02:40,039 --> 00:02:41,400
the ruthless, ambitious traitor,

50
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:43,560
is Li Xiao!

51
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:44,680
Don't move!

52
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:45,400
Li Xiao, you...

53
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:45,719
Get lost!

54
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:53,919
He said you should retreat first.

55
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:55,360
Go deliver the message.

56
00:02:55,599 --> 00:02:56,639
Just go.

57
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:08,919
Zhang Tianyou!

58
00:03:09,439 --> 00:03:10,439
Let me go too,

59
00:03:10,639 --> 00:03:11,639
or I'll kill him!

60
00:03:11,639 --> 00:03:12,479
Then shoot.

61
00:03:15,159 --> 00:03:15,840
Li Xiao,

62
00:03:16,479 --> 00:03:17,240
let me give you some advice.

63
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:18,800
Next time you take a hostage,

64
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:20,759
you'd better make sure your gun is loaded.

65
00:03:20,759 --> 00:03:22,199
Don't try to trick me!

66
00:03:26,199 --> 00:03:27,159
Bastard!

67
00:03:31,319 --> 00:03:32,840
Zhang Tianyou!

68
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:34,719
How did you know my gun was empty?

69
00:03:34,719 --> 00:03:36,280
Because last night,

70
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:38,080
when I sent Leng Feiyan to your room

71
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:40,439
to steal the Talisman Scripture and Celestial Seal,

72
00:03:40,439 --> 00:03:42,000
she also tampered

73
00:03:42,639 --> 00:03:43,719
with your gun.

74
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:46,919
Let's go!

75
00:04:02,759 --> 00:04:04,960
Zhang Tianyou, let me go.

76
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:06,080
Or I'll kill her.

77
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:08,360
Are you sure you're the one holding her hostage?

78
00:04:10,479 --> 00:04:11,840
Then let me remind you.

79
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,719
She is...

80
00:04:13,719 --> 00:04:17,639
the direct disciple of Crimson Point Beyond the Pass.

81
00:04:21,879 --> 00:04:23,079
Let sis teach you

82
00:04:23,079 --> 00:04:25,639
how to properly hold a gun.

83
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,319
All done?

84
00:04:37,079 --> 00:04:37,800
Grab a seat and eat.

85
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:39,720
Zhang Tianyou.

86
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:43,240
Are you really a descendant of the
Dragon-Seeking Zhang Family?

87
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:45,959
Seems your dad never told you.

88
00:04:46,199 --> 00:04:47,920
Back when he was young,

89
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:48,879
he was an external partner of the Zhang Family

90
00:04:48,879 --> 00:04:51,319
and The Four Great Families, right?

91
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:57,959
No.

92
00:04:57,959 --> 00:04:58,879
Impossible.

93
00:04:59,759 --> 00:05:01,000
My dad never mentioned it.

94
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:02,319
That's because your dad knew

95
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:04,000
that with your temper,

96
00:05:04,839 --> 00:05:07,120
the more you know, the faster you die.

97
00:05:07,399 --> 00:05:08,360
Looking at it now,

98
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:09,800
a father knows his son best.

99
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:13,720
The descendant of the Dragon-Seeking Zhang Family
is standing right in front of you.

100
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:15,959
I can use the Zhang Family's Dragon-Seeking Formula

101
00:05:15,959 --> 00:05:17,680
to locate that Tidal Tomb.

102
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:21,120
I've kept you alive this long

103
00:05:21,199 --> 00:05:23,199
just to lure out Warlord Li.

104
00:05:23,199 --> 00:05:25,439
So be a good boy and hit the road with us.

105
00:05:28,759 --> 00:05:31,439
When you old friends, after more than twenty years,

106
00:05:31,439 --> 00:05:33,079
reunite at the old place,

107
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:35,920
you'll surely recall many past events for me, right?

108
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,879
I get it now.

109
00:05:42,160 --> 00:05:42,959
You...

110
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:46,160
You've been baiting me this whole time.

111
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:48,240
Teaming up to play me!

112
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:49,839
Don't say that,

113
00:05:50,279 --> 00:05:51,360
Young Marshal Li.

114
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:54,560
Be glad your dad was one of the participants back then.

115
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:55,399
Otherwise,

116
00:05:55,399 --> 00:05:59,000
do you really think you'd survive this long with your stunts?

117
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:01,920
Men, take him away.

118
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:02,959
Keep a close eye on him.

119
00:06:03,839 --> 00:06:04,680
Don't touch me!

120
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:05,920
Don't let him get hurt!

121
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:08,639
Or he might accidentally kill himself with his own stupidity.

122
00:06:10,839 --> 00:06:11,759
Zhang Tianyou.

123
00:06:12,279 --> 00:06:13,879
With this little combo of yours,

124
00:06:14,639 --> 00:06:16,639
you completely played Li Xiao like a fiddle.

125
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:17,759
What was that about?

126
00:06:17,759 --> 00:06:19,120
When dealing with an idiot like him,

127
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:21,360
you have to speak his language.

128
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:24,439
If he likes to play pretend, we play along.

129
00:06:24,439 --> 00:06:25,519
First, you hit him with the stick,

130
00:06:25,519 --> 00:06:26,720
then you offer him the carrot.

131
00:06:27,519 --> 00:06:28,360
And finally,

132
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:29,240
you tell him

133
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:31,920
that he's been the clown all along.

134
00:06:51,959 --> 00:06:52,439
Young Master,

135
00:06:53,319 --> 00:06:54,480
I don't mean to complain,

136
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:56,240
but it's the middle of the night.

137
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,879
Even the dogs are on their third nap.

138
00:06:58,120 --> 00:07:00,439
And you make us come out to patrol?

139
00:07:00,439 --> 00:07:02,199
We're risking our lives at the Tidal Tomb tomorrow.

140
00:07:02,199 --> 00:07:03,560
Instead of resting up and saving your energy,

141
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:05,160
why are you out here patrolling?

142
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:06,120
Stargazing?

143
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:08,040
It's exactly because we're risking our lives tomorrow

144
00:07:08,639 --> 00:07:10,959
that we absolutely can't sleep tonight.

145
00:07:11,199 --> 00:07:12,279
Don't you know?

146
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:16,120
The Evil Entity is strongest just before a full moon.

147
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:18,279
I'm worried

148
00:07:18,279 --> 00:07:19,839
it might come knocking early.

149
00:07:21,319 --> 00:07:23,120
Is that thing you're talking about

150
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:25,319
harder to deal with than the Zombie in the secret room?

151
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:29,600
You can hold off a Zombie with a black donkey hoof.

152
00:07:29,759 --> 00:07:31,000
But as for the filth in a person's heart...

153
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:32,360
where exactly do you shove a black donkey hoof?

154
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:35,800
Oh no! Jiushuang!

155
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:36,480
Let's go!

156
00:07:38,839 --> 00:07:39,600
Amitabha!

157
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:40,199
God bless us!

158
00:07:40,199 --> 00:07:41,240
May all the gods protect us!

159
00:07:41,839 --> 00:07:43,319
Lingyu!

160
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:44,680
It's me, Jiushuang.

161
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:46,279
Lingyu!

162
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:48,399
Lingyu!

163
00:07:53,519 --> 00:07:54,959
Is Miss Sheng possessed by something?

164
00:07:54,959 --> 00:07:55,720
Look at her complexion.

165
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:56,759
She looks like she was just dug out of a grave.

166
00:07:56,759 --> 00:07:57,560
It's not possession.

167
00:07:58,000 --> 00:07:59,240
It looks like her mind is being controlled.

168
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:13,079
What happened?

169
00:08:13,879 --> 00:08:14,680
Shuang'er!

170
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:16,439
Are you okay?

171
00:08:17,079 --> 00:08:18,160
What happened to Sheng Lingyu?

172
00:08:22,519 --> 00:08:23,319
Tianyou.

173
00:08:25,199 --> 00:08:26,560
Miss Mei.

174
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:28,399
Why am I in your room?

175
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:31,199
Why do you look so pale?

176
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:35,679
You tried to kill me just now.

177
00:08:35,679 --> 00:08:36,639
What?

178
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:38,759
Me, kill you?

179
00:08:38,759 --> 00:08:39,840
That's impossible.

180
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:41,919
I was clearly asleep in my room just now.

181
00:08:45,159 --> 00:08:46,320
Zhang Tianyou.

182
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:48,080
You'd better give me an explanation.

183
00:08:48,519 --> 00:08:51,360
Is this your idea of sincere cooperation?

184
00:08:53,120 --> 00:08:54,240
I get it now.

185
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:58,200
So this is the bizarre nature of that thing.

186
00:08:58,840 --> 00:09:00,559
When The Four Great Families entered the tomb back then,

187
00:09:01,039 --> 00:09:03,080
a disease took root deep in their bloodlines,

188
00:09:03,559 --> 00:09:05,519
and was passed down to their descendants.

189
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:08,519
This disease causes deep sleepwalking,

190
00:09:09,759 --> 00:09:11,360
uncontrollable behavior,

191
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:14,000
and leaves no memory upon waking.

192
00:09:36,799 --> 00:09:37,799
Over the past twenty years,

193
00:09:37,799 --> 00:09:40,120
members of The Four Great Families have been dropping dead.

194
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:44,279
This is the root of it all.

195
00:09:48,879 --> 00:09:51,440
Dad, Tiankun is trying to kill me!

196
00:09:56,279 --> 00:09:57,240
Now,

197
00:09:57,639 --> 00:10:00,039
we must find that Tidal Tomb as soon as possible.

198
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:02,679
To stop these tragedies,

199
00:10:02,919 --> 00:10:04,320
we must crack the tomb and quell the evil.

200
00:10:30,120 --> 00:10:31,919
So my father's sudden death back then...

201
00:10:33,159 --> 00:10:37,120
Some truths are like poisoned daggers.

202
00:10:37,679 --> 00:10:40,279
Not knowing might just keep you alive.

203
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:41,840
But once you do,

204
00:10:42,399 --> 00:10:44,200
it becomes a whole different story.

205
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:45,879
Tianting!

206
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:56,919
Now,

207
00:10:58,480 --> 00:11:00,600
the Evil Entity is breaking free,

208
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:04,039
slowly awakening within us.

209
00:11:11,919 --> 00:11:12,759
Young Master.

210
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:16,759
How is this still an expedition team?

211
00:11:16,919 --> 00:11:18,919
We're obviously a murder squad!

212
00:11:19,039 --> 00:11:20,639
You being the Chief is way too thrilling.

213
00:11:20,639 --> 00:11:22,159
My heart's about to jump out and worship you.

214
00:11:22,159 --> 00:11:22,919
Enough.

215
00:11:24,240 --> 00:11:26,000
Everyone, go back and get ready.

216
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:28,519
Leave behind any unnecessary gear.

217
00:11:28,759 --> 00:11:29,879
Only bring the essentials.

218
00:11:30,080 --> 00:11:31,279
In an hour,

219
00:11:31,279 --> 00:11:32,480
gather in the courtyard.

220
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:34,000
Zhang Tianyou,

221
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:36,399
you'd better really know

222
00:11:36,399 --> 00:11:39,399
how to end all this in that godforsaken place.

223
00:11:39,799 --> 00:11:40,879
Otherwise,

224
00:11:40,879 --> 00:11:43,960
all of us will, before we even arrive,

225
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:46,159
end up slaughtering each other.

226
00:11:49,879 --> 00:11:51,159
Listen closely.

227
00:11:51,759 --> 00:11:52,639
First,

228
00:11:53,519 --> 00:11:54,799
from now on,

229
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:57,000
no one is allowed to sleep alone.

230
00:11:57,039 --> 00:11:58,200
Pair up

231
00:11:58,240 --> 00:11:59,399
and keep an eye on each other.

232
00:11:59,639 --> 00:12:00,200
Ground Rat,

233
00:12:01,159 --> 00:12:02,279
tonight,

234
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:05,960
your voice will be the requiem.

235
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:08,240
If anyone acts strange,

236
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:09,720
sing right into their ear.

237
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:11,679
Sing until they wake up.

238
00:12:11,840 --> 00:12:12,559
The thing is, if I sing,

239
00:12:12,559 --> 00:12:13,639
I'm afraid they'll beat me up.

240
00:12:13,639 --> 00:12:14,480
Second,

241
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:18,639
bring all useful artifacts and medicines.

242
00:12:20,480 --> 00:12:21,240
Third,

243
00:12:21,960 --> 00:12:23,440
and most importantly,

244
00:12:27,279 --> 00:12:28,519
write your wills.

245
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:30,240
This time,

246
00:12:30,480 --> 00:12:34,879
we might be attending our own collective funeral.
